WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.398 --> 00:00:01.949
- That looks so intense
- You know...

00:00:01.949 --> 00:00:02.840
I've seen the show, it's so intense

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:03.860
have you ever tried any of them?

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:06.730
- Well, thank you for asking that Kelly,

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.030
'cause I was about to clarify for those

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:09.920
who are wondering if I
was the really buff guy

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.390
in the tank top, no, I was the

00:00:11.390 --> 00:00:14.017
mildly out of shape guy going wow!

00:00:14.017 --> 00:00:15.110
(audience laughs)

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:16.980
Because I have tried the course

00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.230
and, I'm an athlete,
don't look incredulous

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.520
here Jennifer, I played
baseball in college.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.353
- She is quite an athlete.

00:00:23.353 --> 00:00:24.193
- She's a stud.

00:00:24.193 --> 00:00:25.026
- In all her movies, yeah.

00:00:25.026 --> 00:00:25.859
- Are you kidding in "Alias"?

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:26.692
- Yeah.

00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:28.248
- I would not, she, you would
be a good ninja warrior.

00:00:28.248 --> 00:00:29.081
- Yeah.

00:00:29.081 --> 00:00:30.370
(crowd cheers and applauds)

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:32.340
- I on the other hand,
we actually have footage

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:34.310
of when I tried to do it,

00:00:34.310 --> 00:00:36.090
and there's a moment where you can see,

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:37.840
here it is, there's me, oh!

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:38.729
Yeah!

00:00:38.729 --> 00:00:39.562
(audience laughs)

00:00:39.562 --> 00:00:40.490
You can see the moment where I go

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.603
from I got this to oh noooo!

00:00:44.396 --> 00:00:45.229
- That would be me doing that.

00:00:45.229 --> 00:00:47.337
- I broke my foot doing that
- [Kelly] No!

00:00:47.337 --> 00:00:48.970
and had to have pins in
my foot because of that.

00:00:48.970 --> 00:00:49.803
- [Jennifer] Did you really?

00:00:49.803 --> 00:00:50.636
- What?

00:00:50.636 --> 00:00:52.640
- How many broken bones do you get?

00:00:52.640 --> 00:00:53.533
- Me, or the athletes?

00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:55.646
- No, no, no, the show.

00:00:55.646 --> 00:00:57.590
- The show, shockingly
few, it's been amazing how

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.279
we've really only had a
handful of bad injuries,

00:01:00.279 --> 00:01:01.112
and to a person the worse-

00:01:01.112 --> 00:01:02.121
- Aren't you proud that
you're one of them?

00:01:02.121 --> 00:01:04.363
(laughing)

00:01:04.363 --> 00:01:05.403
- You get that whipping!

00:01:05.403 --> 00:01:07.019
- I feel like that was sarcasm!

00:01:07.019 --> 00:01:08.283
Do you feel like that's a mom going,

00:01:08.283 --> 00:01:09.310
- No.
Don't, are you, are you happy

00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:10.469
with how that turned out?

00:01:10.469 --> 00:01:11.343
(audience laughs)

00:01:11.343 --> 00:01:12.176
- If you're gonna, if you're gonna

00:01:12.176 --> 00:01:13.810
do something, be the best,
that's what you're mom said.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:15.180
- I was the best at being the worst.

00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:16.620
You know what I feel as the host,

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:19.230
my job is to make the
contestants look wonderful

00:01:19.230 --> 00:01:20.464
and I did that.
- [Kelly] Nailed it!

00:01:20.464 --> 00:01:21.326
Nailed it!

00:01:21.326 --> 00:01:23.056
(audience applauds)

00:01:23.056 --> 00:01:24.640
- No but I also know that you took

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.460
on a challenge in high heels, which

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:27.293
I need to know more about.

00:01:27.293 --> 00:01:30.780
- Okay, okay, so I did, I
went on "Lip Sync Battle"

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:32.246
with my parents in the audience and.

00:01:32.246 --> 00:01:33.926
(audience whoops)

00:01:33.926 --> 00:01:35.383
You can't unsee it Jennifer, be careful.

00:01:35.383 --> 00:01:36.496
- [Kelly] I mean.

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:37.620
- [Mark] That is, that is.

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:39.730
- You're my favorite human right now.

00:01:39.730 --> 00:01:40.820
- Now.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:42.853
- Like that, she's an
icon, like what, like.

00:01:42.853 --> 00:01:44.704
- That was Cher for those
who are wondering is,

00:01:44.704 --> 00:01:47.030
was that "Silence Of
The Lambs" the musical?

00:01:47.030 --> 00:01:49.100
No, that was,
- Oh my God!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:53.644
That was me as Cher, "Oh,
oh, I'm a diva now baby."

00:01:53.644 --> 00:01:56.020
I'm six four, I'm a little trimmer now,

00:01:56.020 --> 00:01:59.510
I was 250 then but I was probably six ten,

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:02.210
I had, I had fishnets on with my

00:02:02.210 --> 00:02:03.770
impressive glutes hanging out
- [Jennifer] Sure, sure.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:06.020
And best of all, my 80 year old parents

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:08.520
were in the crowd getting to watch that,

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.926
going, "What happened
to our son the doctor?"

00:02:10.926 --> 00:02:11.890
(audience laughs)

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:13.094
- Where did he go?

00:02:13.094 --> 00:02:14.120
- Where did it go?

00:02:14.120 --> 00:02:16.087
And I just said, "You know, I think I was,

00:02:16.087 --> 00:02:17.740
"I was built to be beautiful."

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:20.206
- I was built to be beautiful and you did,

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:22.336
you did look beautiful!

00:02:22.336 --> 00:02:23.310
For the season finale-

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:25.170
- It's remarkably confident when you're

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:27.630
wearing these high heels
and you got the fishnets on

00:02:27.630 --> 00:02:31.798
and you're out there, "Do you
believe in life after love?"

00:02:31.798 --> 00:02:34.833
- Oh my God you loved it, look at you!

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:35.666
You're reliving it!

00:02:35.666 --> 00:02:36.937
- Literally before I
walked out here they go,

00:02:36.937 --> 00:02:38.620
"Just don't start singing with Kelly."

00:02:38.620 --> 00:02:39.517
And I'm like,
- [Kelly] Oh my God.

00:02:39.517 --> 00:02:41.138
"But some people have
waited a lifetime for

00:02:41.138 --> 00:02:42.805
a moment like this!"

00:02:43.715 --> 00:02:46.397
(audience whoops)

00:02:46.397 --> 00:02:47.230
- That never happened.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:48.980
- Look at Jennifer, she's
so nice, she's like,

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.653
I'm not going to be a
part of this tomfoolery.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:53.453
- Wow.

00:02:53.453 --> 00:02:55.420
- Kelly Clarkson and Matt Iseman can just

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.685
get over there.

00:02:56.685 --> 00:02:57.518
(audience laughs)

00:02:57.518 --> 00:02:58.500
- But the season finale
of "Ninja Warrior" is

00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:00.280
coming up at September
16th, are there any,

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.690
like, really cool moments
you could tell us about?

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:03.750
- So I will let you
guys know this, we don't

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.030
like to do spoilers but we have a winner.

00:03:06.030 --> 00:03:08.530
We have a winner, a
million dollar champion.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:10.560
This is just the second
time in the show's history,

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.170
somebody completes all four stages.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.720
Now, for those who don't know,

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.580
this is our 11th season,
we've only had one winner.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:18.510
This, this is unlike,
this isn't "American Idol"

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.780
where they go, nobody won,
sorry folks, see you next year!

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:25.290
- We have a clip of the
first mom to hit the buzzer,

00:03:25.290 --> 00:03:26.423
so let's watch.

00:03:27.346 --> 00:03:28.179
- Let's go!

00:03:28.179 --> 00:03:30.735
(crowd chants "Sandy, Sandy")

00:03:30.735 --> 00:03:34.266
(crowd goes wild)

00:03:34.266 --> 00:03:35.637
Yes, yes!

00:03:35.637 --> 00:03:38.804
The first mother ever to hit a buzzer!

00:03:39.808 --> 00:03:42.308
(music plays)

00:03:44.048 --> 00:03:46.798
Sandy Zimmerman has made history!

00:03:47.827 --> 00:03:49.856
- All right, let's give it up for the

00:03:49.856 --> 00:03:53.076
ninja course slayer, Sandy Zimmerman,

00:03:53.076 --> 00:03:53.909
come on now.

00:03:53.909 --> 00:03:56.896
(crowd cheers and applauds)

00:03:56.896 --> 00:03:59.140
I mean, I'm so impressed by you, like,

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.660
you're, like you said,
not everybody wins, right?

00:04:01.660 --> 00:04:03.710
Winner, and she's like
a mom holding it down,

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:06.160
like, I can't even get on
a treadmill half the time,

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:08.270
like I can't, like
you're insane, like what,

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:09.790
what kind of impact has
it made on your life

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:10.623
after winning?

00:04:10.623 --> 00:04:13.557
- Ohh well, it has been
absolutely amazing.

00:04:13.557 --> 00:04:14.390
- [Kelly] Look at your guns!

00:04:14.390 --> 00:04:15.656
- I know they're distracting aren't they?

00:04:15.656 --> 00:04:16.608
They're distracting.

00:04:16.608 --> 00:04:17.820
- They're so cool, yeah.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:18.857
Mine look so different.

00:04:18.857 --> 00:04:20.570
- Well my abs are covered,
those are even more distracting.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.627
- Oh, so are, so are mine.

00:04:22.627 --> 00:04:24.080
(audience laughs)

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.507
I'm doing a couple loads.

00:04:26.507 --> 00:04:27.340
It's like yeah, yeah.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.220
But how has it changed your life?

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:31.100
- Erm you know, it was incredible,

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:33.040
it was amazing, it was this big dream,

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:36.330
you know four years ago,
I heard there was no mom

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:38.380
had ever made it through
the course and hit a buzzer.

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.870
And I thought, "We need
to get a mom up there."

00:04:40.870 --> 00:04:42.320
We need to get a mom up there.

00:04:42.320 --> 00:04:43.332
- Yeah.

00:04:43.332 --> 00:04:44.165
- I'm really glad it was me.

00:04:44.165 --> 00:04:44.998
- Yeah!

00:04:44.998 --> 00:04:45.831
- But, but we need to get a mom up there.

00:04:45.831 --> 00:04:46.915
- It's incredibly difficult.

00:04:46.915 --> 00:04:47.965
- [Sandy] Yeah it is.

